ng Lake Howard, perfect for relaxing with your morning coffee or unwinding at the end of the day. Both bedrooms feature comfortable living space, and an additional bonus area off one of the bedrooms provides the perfect spot for a home office, reading nook, or creative workspace. Everyday convenience is made easy with onsite laundry facilities available for tenants. Pets welcome with monthly pet rent, no dangerous breeds. With its warm hardwood floors, unique architectural details, abundant natural light, and flexible living areas, this distinctive rental offers a wonderful place to call home in Winter Haven. If you're looking for a home with character and charm, this property is worth a look! The apartment is situated near Lake Howard, part of Winter Haven's famous Chain of Lakes, creating a lifestyle centered around boating, fishing, walking, biking, and enjoying the outdoors. The location also puts you close to the heart of Winter Haven, with its historic downtown, local restaurants, shops, parks, community events, and growing collection of places to enjoy the city's distinctive small-town atmosphere. We conduct a full background screening including credit, income verification, landlord references, and eviction history. While we review the entire applicant profile, a minimum credit score of 550 is generally required. Come experience the charm of the Lucia Apartments and see why this unique studio feels like much more than an ordinary apartment. Schedule your showing today!","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1300,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/abda2dbf082c5b55af90fd7f74493d59l-m1900294023r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["house_view","yard","complete","front","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/abda2dbf082c5b55af90fd7f74493d59l-m1900294023s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/abda2dbf082c5b55af90fd7f74493d59l-m1900294023r.jpg"],"res